    <task id="LOCAL-00001" summary="- Finished implementing Hallowed one and made Void and Hallowed mobs attack each other.&#10;- Added some new Hallowed items.&#10;- Removed vanilla mobs &amp; structures from biome spawn lists.&#10;- Made Elves and Corrupted Elves attack each other.&#10;- Added the first five AltDim OST tracks: Fallen Hero, Lost Ruins, Outcast, Fading Away, and Final Struggle.&#10;- Converted more vanilla blocks/items to custom versions.&#10;- Added &amp; fixed custom crafting tables for different woods.&#10;- Added Romans, Vikings, their drops, and their reputation mechanic.&#10;- Added wooden tools for all wood types.&#10;- Added Phosphorium and Phosphorium Tools.&#10;- Rebalanced ore generation.&#10;- Added custom furnaces for each strata type.&#10;- Migrated glass and bowls over to custom ones.&#10;- Added new mobs and structures.&#10;- Tweaked recipes and loot tables to further migrate away from vanilla blocks and items.&#10;- Added more custom alternatives for vanilla stuff.&#10;- Added (buggy) aluminum buckets.&#10;- Added decorative platform blocks.&#10;- Added Beetle Queen and beetle variants, as well as the Scorched Tower.&#10;- Fixed many bugs">
