    <task id="LOCAL-00002" summary="- Deleted Ice Cream Hills &amp; Candy Forest Biomes&#10;- Deleted Sugar Blocks and Chocolate Bar&#10;- Somewhat fixed the candy jetpack&#10;- Made some changes to worldgen&#10;- Fixed the Roman Spear&#10;- Added Shroomium Tools and made Shroomium Ore only breakable with mushy tools.&#10;- Added Graphite Rod.&#10;- Added Bow Utility procedures.&#10;- Added Planet Core.&#10;- Various minor changes and fixes.">
