    <task id="LOCAL-00003" summary="- Did a full refactor after merging from remote dev.&#10;- Fully fixed Instatunnel and added Instavator.&#10;- Added textures for pulling stages of Scorched Bow.&#10;- Made Umberflower generate naturally, and made a recipe to convert it to black dye.&#10;- Added Possessed Armor entity.&#10;- Added stone-tier tools for shale, veridium, and mantle.&#10;- Made various changes and fixes after the first playtest.&#10;- Added the Greenwood wood set.">
