    <task id="LOCAL-00005" summary="- Refactored workspace to 2026.2 and Minecraft Neoforge 26.1.2.&#10;- Added many zombie variants.&#10;- Added the Blood Moon and support for other world events.&#10;- Other various minor fixes and changes.">
