    <task id="LOCAL-00006" summary="- Added many new materials and items, including Mana Stones, Mana Crystals, and tech components like Mana Coils and Circuits, importers, exporters, and drivetrain belts.&#10;- Completely deleted the old machine system and reimplemented a new, better, more user- and automation-friendly system based around &quot;mana.&quot;&#10;- Added two new structures to partly replace the deleted Pasta Mall.&#10;- Removed the Hexagem Complex and derivatives.&#10;- Made the recipes for the high-tier math weapons harder to get, requiring Aluminum and/or Mana Stones&#10;- Added physical blocks for Lemons and Limes, and made them and the Pear growth generate on Lush Forest trees and a new Fruit tree in the Fruity Gardens&#10;- Half-implemented the Blue Moon event - no special moon texture yet, but blue fog.&#10;- Buffed the portal wand recipe.&#10;- Added four new gems with their own gem blocks&#10;- Added the Iron Giant boss.&#10;- Added the Crude Salve and Crude Bandage&#10;- Added flesh drops for all the new zombie variants&#10;- Added two new flowers: the Cheeseflower and Magister's Bloom&#10;- Added Evilstone and Holystone tools, which give damage buffs to Hallowed and Void mobs, respectively.&#10;- Added three new spider variants: the Hydra, Venomous, and Incendiary spiders, each with their own special abilities.&#10;- Added the wooden club and a simple upgrade using venom glands, another new item.&#10;- Finally implemented a graphite rod recipe.&#10;- Added a Gem ore that drops a random gem, rather than the geodes (which were deleted)&#10;- Finally added a use for corn: Popcorn!&#10;- Many, many, many other minor fixes and changes.">
      <option name="closed" value="true" />
      <created>1785073179667</created>
      <option name="number" value="00006" />
      <option name="presentableId" value="LOCAL-00006" />
      <option name="project" value="LOCAL" />
